  Description: '[Legacy - Age of Ashes] One or more of your parents (either biological
    or adoptive) were heroes of the Age of Ashes Adventure Path. Others tend to treat
    you with a bit more respect, or perhaps fear your connections to people of great
    power. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma , and
    one is a free attribute boost. You''re trained in the Intimidation skill, and
    the Genealogy Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group
    Coercion] skill feat.'
